text = "[b]WELCOME TO THE ASHBINDERS TEST ENVIRONMENT[/b]
This prototype demonstrates the core game loop: [i]Explore → Fight → Extract Ember → Socket Ember → Activate Machine → Open Route → Save Game[/i].

[b]🎨 VISUAL ASSET LEGEND (Placeholder Geometry):[/b]
• [color=#3388EE]■ Dark Blue Capsule[/color]: [b]Kael (Ashbinder Protagonist)[/b]
• [color=#EE4433]● Crimson Circle[/color]: [b]Ember Beast (Underlevels)[/b] — Fast melee chaser; drops Motion Ember.
• [color=#667799]⬡ Steel Hexagon[/color]: [b]Debug Armored Dummy[/b] — Heavy defense. [i]Requires Hammer Head [Key 2] to break armor![/i]
• [color=#33CCDD]○ Teal Halo Circle[/color]: [b]Archivist Vael (NPC)[/b] — Approach and press [b]E[/b] to talk.
• [color=#FFAA22]● Amber Glowing Orb[/color]: [b]Motion Ember[/b] — Boosts dash speed / powers Ancient Device.
• [color=#4488FF]● Blue Glowing Orb[/color]: [b]Guard Ember[/b] — Drops from Armored Enemy.
• [color=#FFBB22]◈ Golden Altar[/color]: [b]Ancient Ember Device[/b] — Accepts Motion Ember to unlock Vault Gate.
• [color=#FF7722]❚ Barrier Gate[/color]: [b]Ember Gate[/b] — Unlocks when Ancient Device is powered.
• [color=#FFDD33]★ Golden Pillar[/color]: [b]Ancient Save Anchor[/b] — Interact with [b]E[/b] to save full game state!

[b]🎮 CONTROLS:[/b]
• [b]WASD / Arrow Keys[/b]: Movement | [b]Space / K[/b]: Kinetic Dash
• [b]Left Click / J[/b]: Attack | [b]1, 2, 3, 4 / Q[/b]: Switch Weapon Head (Blade / Hammer / Sickles / Spear)
• [b]E[/b]: Interact / Talk / Extract / Power Machine / Save at Anchor
• [b]F[/b]: Socket / Unsocket Ember in Ashbinder Chain"

